## .NET Performance Analysis — `StringReadability.cs`

**Context:** Hot path — called on every user-facing string in a CMS rendering hundreds of dynamic strings per page.

### Scan Execution Checklist

| Recipe | Hits |
|--------|------|
| `.ToLower()`/`.ToUpper()` no culture | 3 |
| Chained `.Replace()` 3+ | 0 |
| `params` signatures | 2 |
| LINQ `.All`/`.Any` | 4 |
| `.Replace(` | 1 |
| `.Contains(string)` no `StringComparison` | 2 |
| LINQ `.Select`/`.Cast`/`.Aggregate` | 5 |
| `string.Split(` | 2 |
| `RegexOptions.Compiled` (downlevel) | 2 |
| `[GeneratedRegex]` (modern) | 2 |
| `new Regex(` uncached | 0 |
